  "edition": 11,
  "rng_seed": 42,
  "transition_to_phase": 7,
  "disable_ai": true,
  "description": "Codex: Orks (11e) army rule UNSTABLE ENERGIES (WP-O34): a PSYKER's psychic abilities in one battle round may not exceed its psyker level. Fixture ork11e_o34_active, detachment switched to Wurrband (setup) so the Weirdboy (psyker level 1) knows Roar of Mork and Visions of Violence (psychic level 1 each); setup moves the Weirdboy 41\",24\" (enemies within 12\"). Round 2, Movement phase: a real click on End Movement Phase opens the movement_phase_end window with ROAR OF MORK (FREE); Use -> the enemy pick (Blade Champion Alpha) -> the psychic roll + the enemy battle-shock roll; 1 of 1 psychic level is spent, no CP. A second use the same round is refused with the Unstable Energies reason. At the start of the Fight phase VISIONS OF VIOLENCE is not offered and the player is told why (Game Log + toast). The turn and the Custodes' turn are played out (War Cry window declined by a real click); at round 3 the budget is back: End Movement Phase offers ROAR OF MORK again.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "act": "wait_seconds",
      "seconds": 0.8
    },
    {
      "act": "expect_phase",
      "equals": 7
    },
    {
      "act": "execute_script",
      "multiline": true,
      "script": "var p = PhaseManager.get_current_phase_instance()\nfor i in range(4):\n\tif p == null or not p.has_pending_stratagem_window():\n\t\tbreak\n\tvar w = p.get_pending_stratagem_window()\n\tNetworkIntegration.route_action({\"type\": \"DECLINE_WINDOW_STRATAGEM\", \"player\": int(w.get(\"player\", 1)), \"window_id\": str(w.get(\"window_id\", \"\"))})\nreturn true",
      "equals": true,
      "comment": "WP-O6: the Weirdboy's codex Da Jump is offered at the start of the Movement phase — not under test, declined"
    },
    {
      "act": "wait_seconds",
      "seconds": 0.5
    },
    {
      "act": "expect_state",
      "path": "meta.battle_round",
      "equals": 2
    },
    {
      "act": "execute_script",
      "script": "GameState.state[\"factions\"][\"1\"][\"detachment\"] = \"Wurrband\"\nStratagemManager.load_faction_stratagems_for_player(1)\nFactionAbilityManager.detect_player_detachment(1)\nload(\"res://scripts/codex/orks/OrkDetachments11e.gd\").apply_keyword_grants(1)\nSettingsService.set(\"auto_allocate_wounds\", true)\nvar _ms_U_WEIRDBOY_A = GameState.state.units[\"U_WEIRDBOY_A\"].models\nfor _i in range(_ms_U_WEIRDBOY_A.size()):\n\t_ms_U_WEIRDBOY_A[_i][\"position\"] = {\"x\": (41.000000 + (float(_i) - float(_ms_U_WEIRDBOY_A.size() - 1) / 2.0) * 1.600000) * 40.0, \"y\": 24.000000 * 40.0}\ntree.current_scene._recreate_unit_visuals()\nreturn FactionAbilityManager.get_player_detachment(1)",
      "multiline": true,
      "equals": "Wurrband",
      "comment": "setup privilege: the fixture's Ork detachment is switched to Wurrband (stratagems + detachment rules reloaded)"
    },
    {
      "act": "execute_script",
      "script": "return load(\"res://scripts/codex/orks/OrkArmyRules11e.gd\").psyker_level(GameState.state.units[\"U_WEIRDBOY_A\"])\n",
      "multiline": true,
      "equals": 1,
